{"name": "SuperBird", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the SuperBird Arena, home to roaring crowds, oddball contenders, and the most unruly hand of cards you\u2019ll ever see. Step into the spotlight with a cage full of misbehaving bugs, conquer four wildly different arenas, and prove you\u2019ve got what it takes to wear the crown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/f872e00e319b1c81088114400c58a0b2.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your own bug cage and make every bug count. Each turn, they may crawl to new positions, devour one another, or even fly back to the cage. But chaos can be an opportunity. Use your bird\u2019s abilities to steer the swarm, turn disorder into setup, and chain it all into a winning combo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/8efe1893cbf99437364297612b3f7a21.poster.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/8efe1893cbf99437364297612b3f7a21.webm?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/8efe1893cbf99437364297612b3f7a21.mp4?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/0bfb9c27f28b76ee523a4f081bd4bc17.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The contenders stepping into the arena are actual birds. Choose from a bumbling duck, an aloof crow, or an adorable long-tailed tit, each with their own abilities and signature skills. Pair them with all kinds of trinkets to uncover powerful synergies, pull off ridiculous combos, and send your score soaring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"740\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/577d2c5dc0739604b0e2579c6e5842d2.poster.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/577d2c5dc0739604b0e2579c6e5842d2.webm?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/577d2c5dc0739604b0e2579c6e5842d2.mp4?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/967e0fe46835757d3c84e2766fb6714a.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your road to the crown spans four arenas, each with its own rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Take on fellow birds high above the clouds in the Sky Arena, where there\u2019s no such thing as a fixed schedule.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Enter the Old God Cup at an underwater tavern, then grab a drink between brawls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf Descend into the Abyss Arena, where contenders of every species are welcome to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u25cf And as for the mysterious arena hidden deep in the forest... first, you\u2019ll have to figure out how to qualify.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"352\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/5bd337135cd79f48927f214d9145d3a8.poster.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/5bd337135cd79f48927f214d9145d3a8.webm?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/5bd337135cd79f48927f214d9145d3a8.mp4?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/098133c252b75bc7d431e5ba355c44b3.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between matches, your camp is where you grow stronger. Spend the stars you earn in the arena to improve your bug cage, campfire, and tent\u2014every upgrade quietly tips the odds in your next match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/158882bfb944a270a8063e9589af8202.poster.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/158882bfb944a270a8063e9589af8202.webm?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/158882bfb944a270a8063e9589af8202.mp4?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/7328300d3835cd79b39475d91afa4a5a.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1200\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The crowd will cheer your best plays\u2014and roast you just as loudly when things go wrong. The mouse host is always ready to stir the pot, while defeated rivals may end up in the stands, cheering you on instead. Taunt your opponents, work the crowd, and watch the tips roll in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"216\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/0db2b8cfee83315dc3d4a30e3d212973.poster.avif?t=1794281982\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/0db2b8cfee83315dc3d4a30e3d212973.webm?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/extras/0db2b8cfee83315dc3d4a30e3d212973.mp4?t=1794281982\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every animal has its own part to play on your road to the crown.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "SuperBird is a roguelike deckbuilder starring birds and bugs. our cards crawl, grow, and even devour one another. Learn each bug\u2019s quirks, build around them with powerful trinkets, and time your plays to perfection under the arena spotlight. Climb your way to the top and claim the crown!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4189690/966c29bf8fbab7fe2067ab580e7403127ae978ae/header.jpg?t=1794281982", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Card Battler", "Deckbuilding", "Card Game", "Turn-Based Tactics", "Roguelike", "Singleplayer"], "developers": "Wild Motion", "publishers": "Wild Motion", "release_date": "Q2 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4189690", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 November 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BroYGZ-hKKs", "first_seen": 1794265200.0, "review_rank": 4}